OL,6,     FFiat 126/Bentley GT Continental:
OL,7,     FIt's a battle of little and large
OL,8,     Fas the team get creative with a
OL,9,     F1996 Fiat 126 and then run their
OL,10,     Fown consumer test on a 2004
OL,11,     FBentley Continental GT.
OL,12,G2200 Bangers & Cash
OL,13,     FMorris Traveller / Subaru Impreza
OL,14,     FP: The Mathewsons sell a 1958
OL,15,     FBedford D122 and a 1969 Vanden
OL,16,     FPlas Princess, and meet a
OL,17,     Fcollector who may be willing to
OL,18,     Fpart with a huge hot hatch
OL,19,     Fcollection.
