OL,11,     Fan RS2000 come up for auction.
OL,12,G0000 Bangers & Cash
OL,13,     FTriumph Herald/Renault Caravelle:
OL,14,     FDerek heads to rain-soaked Ripon
OL,15,     Fto pick up a 1965 Ford Anglia with
OL,16,     F33,000 miles on the clock, while
OL,17,     FDave's loving the clean lines of a
OL,18,     Frare Renault Caravalle.
